{"pulled_at": "2026-10-26T16:42:00Z", "test": false, "user": {"data": {"created_at": "2024-03-14T20:15:16.000Z", "description": "Turn-based tactics in the browser. One fight, then the map shrinks. No install. No wallet to start\n\ud83d\udfe6", "id": "1768370292353884160", "name": "Heroes Of Crypto (HOCAI)", "pinned_tweet_id": "2110567307013726582", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 91, "following_count": 8, "like_count": 16, "listed_count": 1, "media_count": 52, "tweet_count": 182}, "username": "Heroes0fcrypto"}}, "posts": {"data": [{"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-26T14:00:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114718707692052879"], "id": "2114718707692052879", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1768370292353884160", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114718534668542221", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Any unit can also break a barrel itself, in melee or with a shot, and one hit is enough. Do you clear the lane first, or bring the shooter that ignores it? https://t.co/gdYw9HVfcS", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2114718707692052879"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-26T13:59:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114718534668542221"], "id": "2114718534668542221", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Barrels block shots. An ordinary ranged attack stops at the first barrel in its lane, and Double Shot spends up to two of its projectiles clearing barrels instead of the target.\n\nCyclops and Gargantuan don't care. Their shots fly over and smash the barrels caught in the blast.", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2114718534668542221"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-25T23:52:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114505421713244429"], "id": "2114505421713244429", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1768370292353884160", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114505340717052321", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Which of their artifacts would change your augment pick the most? https://t.co/gdYw9HVfcS", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2114505421713244429"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-25T23:52:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114505340717052321"], "id": "2114505340717052321", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "New in v0.1.7: while you choose your augments, you can see the artifacts the other player drafted.\n\nSo the draft becomes a read. They took Last Fuse? Spread your army out. Farsight Quiver? Expect archers shooting from deep.\n\nYou get to answer before the first turn.", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2114505340717052321"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-25T18:54:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114430323241234683"], "id": "2114430323241234683", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1768370292353884160", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114430258531491882", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Hunter's Longbow and the Sniper augment's attack bonus still apply on top. Would you rather have full damage at range, or Quiver of Echoes' 40% chance of an extra attack? https://t.co/gdYw9HVfcS", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2114430323241234683"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-25T18:53:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114430258531491882"], "id": "2114430258531491882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "New in v0.1.7: Farsight Quiver.\n\nEvery allied archer's shot stays at full damage at any distance. No more range falloff.\n\nIt does not add range, and a shot that crosses Smoke is still halved.\n\nSo your archers can sit deep in the back line. Smoke is what you play around.", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2114430258531491882"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-25T13:58:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114355969702690993"], "id": "2114355969702690993", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1768370292353884160", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114355783316234718", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "A blast that kills another stack sets off its own explosion, so a packed line can chain. Resurrection cancels the burst and a Water Shield absorbs one. Which stack would you light first? https://t.co/gdYw9HVfcS", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2114355969702690993"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-25T13:57:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114355783316234718"], "id": "2114355783316234718", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "New in v0.1.7: Last Fuse. When your army destroys an enemy stack, it explodes into every enemy touching it, for 25% of the killing blow or 25 damage per point of the attacker's stack power, whichever is higher.\n\nYour units are safe. Kill the stack in their crowd first.", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2114355783316234718"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-25T05:03:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114221234204655790"], "id": "2114221234204655790", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1768370292353884160", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114221184820949464", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "One catch: a smaller stack has less stack power, so a spell that needs more power can still be locked. Would you split a caster to cast the same spell twice? https://t.co/gdYw9HVfcS", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2114221234204655790"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-25T05:03:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114221184820949464"], "id": "2114221184820949464", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Dev diary: splitting a stack used to split its spell charges. The new stack's share was rounded down, so a lone Resurrection stayed with the original.\n\nSince v0.1.7, every split stack keeps a full copy of the spellbook, even a lone caster. Merging back keeps the larger count.", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2114221184820949464"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-23T13:53:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113630011953647671"], "id": "2113630011953647671", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1768370292353884160", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113629959646503249", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Walking into a Fire Wall still spends the shield on one burn, and the weapon hit under a Fireforged burn can still break it. Do you pop it with a cheap stack, or burn around it? https://t.co/gdYw9HVfcS", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2113630011953647671"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-23T13:53:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113629959646503249"], "id": "2113629959646503249", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Dev diary: fire used to pop a Mermaid's Water Shield.\n\nThe shield zeroes the first damage she takes in a fight. Since v0.1.7, fire passes through and leaves it up: Fireball, Fire Breath, Fire Shield, a Fireforged burn.\n\nSo if you want it gone, spend a non-fire hit on it first.", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2113629959646503249"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-22T23:50:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113417854838030429"], "id": "2113417854838030429", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1768370292353884160", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113417759832838360", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Moving the pointer off the board clears their aimed cell, and a shot taken after a move is drawn from where the shooter lands. Does seeing their aim change how you play your turn? https://t.co/gdYw9HUHnk", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2113417854838030429"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-22T23:50:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113417759832838360"], "id": "2113417759832838360", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Dev diary: until v0.1.7, you couldn't see what the other player was aiming at in a ranked fight.\n\nNow their aim shows on your board as they pick it: a move, a shot, a spell, even which way a Through Shot points.\n\nPvP should feel like someone is across the table.", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2113417759832838360"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-22T18:59:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113344594238693413"], "id": "2113344594238693413", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1768370292353884160", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113344487489765745", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "The Queen takes it with Predatory Assimilation. Which enemy would you pull into your Harpy's old cell first? Try a swap in the sandbox: https://t.co/OebqIMc6ws", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2113344594238693413"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-22T18:59:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113344487489765745"], "id": "2113344487489765745", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Castling lets a Harpy swap places with an enemy. When an Arachna Queen stole it, our spellbook lit up every enemy in reach and the engine refused each click.\n\nNow a swap trades bodies of the same size, 2x2 for 2x2, and since 2 Oct it reaches one cell past movement.", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2113344487489765745"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-22T13:57:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113268575997768013"], "id": "2113268575997768013", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1768370292353884160", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113268425623486700", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Which side do you read a fight from? It's in Settings, Gameplay, Your side of the battlefield. Random, the default, changes nothing.\nhttps://t.co/gdYw9HUHnk", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2113268575997768013"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-22T13:57:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113268425623486700"], "id": "2113268425623486700", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Dev diary: a PvP match seats you on the left or the right. Now you can choose the side you see your army on. Only your screen is mirrored: the engine, the log and every cell stay exactly as dealt, and replays and spectators keep the true sides. Unit labels still read forward.", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2113268425623486700"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-21T23:54:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113056355137540318"], "id": "2113056355137540318", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1768370292353884160", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113056295360094346", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "The same guard ate every ranked attack on a mountain until we fixed that in July. Line up a Through Shot yourself: https://t.co/gdYw9HVfcS", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2113056355137540318"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-21T23:54:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113056295360094346"], "id": "2113056295360094346", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Dev diary: on our test server, the Tsar Cannon drew its aim line through several stacks, and the click did nothing.\n\nA guard that drops moves aimed off the grid also dropped every free-aimed shot, as that shot aims at a point, not a cell. The server never saw it.\n\nFixed 25 Sep.", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2113056295360094346"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-21T18:55:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112981155200819317"], "id": "2112981155200819317", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1768370292353884160", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112981039270522892", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "When a fight slips away, which turn do you rewind to first: your opening placement, or the move where it turned? https://t.co/gdYw9HUHnk", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2112981155200819317"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-21T18:55:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112981039270522892"], "id": "2112981039270522892", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Dev diary: yesterday we said replays lost barrels and fire walls. That was half of it.\n\nA replay also dropped the real combat log, the damage graph and the turn clock. A Flesh Shield bearer killed by damage it soaked up just vanished.\n\nFixed 20 Sep. Now a replay shows the fight.", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2112981039270522892"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-21T13:58:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112906340259540994"], "id": "2112906340259540994", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1768370292353884160", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112906246567399593", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Either way, the queue tells you before it happens. Try both lines in the sandbox: https://t.co/gdYw9HUHnk", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2112906340259540994"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-21T13:57:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112906246567399593"], "id": "2112906246567399593", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Their fastest stack acts next in the queue. Do you pull your shooter out of reach, or leave something cheap in its path and make them spend the turn on it?", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2112906246567399593"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-20T23:54:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112693963631313221"], "id": "2112693963631313221", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1768370292353884160", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112693816994201854", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "When you rewatch a fight you lost, what do you check first: the queue, or the cells you could not stand on? https://t.co/gdYw9HVfcS", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2112693963631313221"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-20T23:53:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112693816994201854"], "id": "2112693816994201854", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Dev diary: our replays used to lie about the board. Barrels and fire walls went missing, so a barrel map replayed on bare ground and a Fire Wall was a flash with no burn.\n\nLive play put the terrain back after each rebuild. Replays never did. Now the terrain travels with them.", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2112693816994201854"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-20T18:53:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112618214522032309"], "id": "2112618214522032309", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1768370292353884160", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112618090542616657", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "No Melee is the whole constraint. The sandbox is there to see the pin happen on purpose: https://t.co/gdYw9HVfcS", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2112618214522032309"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-20T18:52:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112618090542616657"], "id": "2112618090542616657", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Tsar Cannon does not punch. Once a melee stack is standing on it, the gun is furniture. Move it while the queue still lets you.", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2112618090542616657"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-20T13:55:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112543170269692271"], "id": "2112543170269692271", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1768370292353884160", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112543116544889027", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Luck stays in the fight. It should not be the only way you win: https://t.co/pxHT7VwELS", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2112543170269692271"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-20T13:55:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112543116544889027"], "id": "2112543116544889027", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A plan that needs the high roll is not a plan. Leave another unit able to act if the first hit comes up short.", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2112543116544889027"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-19T23:53:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112331382869615008"], "id": "2112331382869615008", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1768370292353884160", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112331270386860113", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "We fixed the guide in September. So a surge is not a free move, it is a better place in line. Does that change which stack you finish first? https://t.co/pxHT7VwELS", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2112331382869615008"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-19T23:53:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112331270386860113"], "id": "2112331270386860113", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Our own guide got Morale wrong. It said a Morale unit gets another action. The engine never gives one. Morale moves the unit ahead of the queue and it hits a quarter harder. Dismorale sends it behind everyone, hitting softer. One turn either way.", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2112331270386860113"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-19T18:56:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112256603600638111"], "id": "2112256603600638111", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1768370292353884160", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112256493034623098", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "What the opening is allowed to be: https://t.co/9PkBIH6oWG", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2112256603600638111"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-19T18:56:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112256493034623098"], "id": "2112256493034623098", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The first move is a handshake. A step that does not claim a cell, a lane, or an aura range told the other player nothing.", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2112256493034623098"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-19T13:53:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112180463754231965"], "id": "2112180463754231965", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1768370292353884160", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112180382678610386", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Health says whether it can take a hit. The queue says whether that hit arrives before you can move it.", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2112180463754231965"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-19T13:53:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112180382678610386"], "id": "2112180382678610386", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Before you move a wounded stack: do you check who acts next, or do you check how much health it has left?", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2112180382678610386"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-18T23:55:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111969556138688776"], "id": "2111969556138688776", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1768370292353884160", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2111969404565250121", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "The hunt, not the wall: https://t.co/ap7MlsdnTp", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2111969556138688776"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-18T23:55:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111969404565250121"], "id": "2111969404565250121", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Nature can lose the straight brawl and still win, if the other player chased one stack into a board that no longer has a way out.", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2111969404565250121"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-18T18:52:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111893175274983766"], "id": "2111893175274983766", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1768370292353884160", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2111892951626350973", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Protect purpose, not just hit points: https://t.co/9PkBIH6oWG", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2111893175274983766"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-18T18:51:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111892951626350973"], "id": "2111892951626350973", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Pinning a ranged stack is not a hit on that stack. It is a hit on the reason the rest of the army was standing there.", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2111892951626350973"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-18T13:59:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111819523087081888"], "id": "2111819523087081888", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1768370292353884160", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2111819309269835920", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "We delete the outer cells on purpose. I want the opening you would actually play, not the one that looks brave.", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2111819523087081888"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-18T13:58:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111819309269835920"], "id": "2111819309269835920", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "If you learned flanking in Heroes of Might and Magic: do you still open on the edge when that edge is going to disappear?", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2111819309269835920"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-17T23:53:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111606435058684023"], "id": "2111606435058684023", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1768370292353884160", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2111606394281500728", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "The faction is weight, and the weight has to be earned: https://t.co/ap7MlsdVIX", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2111606435058684023"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-17T23:52:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111606394281500728"], "id": "2111606394281500728", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Might is not walking forward and hoping the hit arrives. It is building a contact the other army cannot step out of.", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2111606394281500728"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-17T18:59:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111532605841588606"], "id": "2111532605841588606", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1768370292353884160", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2111532527114506733", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Give the ranged line and the healer different cells: https://t.co/9PkBIH6oWG", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2111532605841588606"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-17T18:59:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111532527114506733"], "id": "2111532527114506733", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Packing the army into one knot feels loyal. The first area hit is why it was not.", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2111532527114506733"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-17T13:56:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111456352145154096"], "id": "2111456352145154096", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1768370292353884160", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2111456161060815313", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Through Shot carries the hit through the targets. The fix is the file, not more armor. Play it: https://t.co/gdYw9HVfcS", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2111456352145154096"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-17T13:55:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111456161060815313"], "id": "2111456161060815313", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Tsar Cannon does not stop on the first stack. Three units in a file is one shot you lined up for them. https://t.co/DfiPpCBiFm", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2111456161060815313"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-16T23:58:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111245446819811489"], "id": "2111245446819811489", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1768370292353884160", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2111245321292423194", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Life is stubborn, not safe: https://t.co/ap7MlsdVIX", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2111245446819811489"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-16T23:58:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111245321292423194"], "id": "2111245321292423194", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A Life army that only heals, and never steps forward, runs out of board. The saved stack still needs a cell to matter on.", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2111245321292423194"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-16T18:52:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111168457140302204"], "id": "2111168457140302204", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1768370292353884160", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2111168270522822947", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Same day, we fixed a player who dropped for a second and lost their seat for the rest of the match. Now they come back into the fight. PvP is mostly that kind of work.", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2111168457140302204"}, {"author_id": "1768370292353884160", "created_at": "2026-10-16T18:51:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111168270522822947"], "id": "2111168270522822947", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A bug from last month: every time the board shrank, it flashed back to full size for one frame before the cut ring vanished again.\n\nFor one frame, the board lied about the one rule the game is built on. The fix keeps the layers that already shrank and only draws the new ring.", "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2111168270522822947"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "1768370292353884160", "name": "Heroes Of Crypto (HOCAI)", "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1985398322899914752/o3g_3J0K_normal.jpg", "username": "Heroes0fcrypto", "verified": false}]}, "meta": {"result_count": 52}}}